---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
---
<section id="why-us" class="outsourcing-value" aria-labelledby="value-heading">
  <div class="shell">
    <div class="section-heading-row reveal-on-scroll">
      <div><p class="section-kicker"><span>01 / THE ADVANTAGE</span><span class="kicker-rule" aria-hidden="true"></span></p><h2 id="value-heading">Less on your plate.<br /><span>More in your corner.</span></h2></div>
      <p class="section-intro">Your finance function should make growth easier. Bring the right people and processes into the picture, without building everything in-house.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="value-columns">
      <article class="value-column value-capacity reveal-on-scroll">
        <div class="value-art" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 230 130" fill="none"><rect x="66" y="12" width="91" height="94" rx="9" fill="#E7DFF9" transform="rotate(12 66 12)" /><rect x="41" y="31" width="101" height="83" rx="9" fill="#F6CBB3" transform="rotate(-9 41 31)" /><rect x="62" y="29" width="103" height="85" rx="9" fill="white" stroke="#C4D5F3" /><path d="M79 49h39M79 60h68M79 71h55" stroke="#CDD7EC" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" /><path d="M79 92h23" stroke="#2563EB" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round" /><rect x="146" y="78" width="37" height="37" rx="8" fill="#2563EB" /><path d="M157 96h15m-7-7v15" stroke="white" stroke-width="1.5" /></svg>
          <span class="value-index">01</span>
        </div>
        <p class="value-label">SPACE TO GROW</p><h3>More capacity.<br />Fewer growing pains.</h3>
        <p class="value-description">Add accounting support as workloads change. Keep routine work moving while your internal team focuses on the bigger decisions.</p>
        <span class="value-footnote">Flexible support, built around you<Icon name="arrow-up-right" size={14} /></span>
      </article>
      <article class="value-column value-control reveal-on-scroll">
        <div class="value-art" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 230 130" fill="none"><rect x="49" y="20" width="135" height="90" rx="11" fill="#F0ECFF" /><path d="M68 43h96M68 65h96M68 87h96" stroke="#D5C9ED" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" /><rect x="84" y="35" width="18" height="16" rx="5" fill="#9277CB" /><rect x="131" y="57" width="18" height="16" rx="5" fill="#F4BF9F" /><rect x="104" y="79" width="18" height="16" rx="5" fill="#9277CB" /><path d="M42 34V20a9 9 0 0 1 9-9h15m110 88v14a9 9 0 0 1-9 9h-15" stroke="#B9A5DB" stroke-width="1.5" /></svg>
          <span class="value-index">02</span>
        </div>
        <p class="value-label">OVERSIGHT, INCLUDED</p><h3>Stay connected.<br />Stay in control.</h3>
        <p class="value-description">Know who owns each task, what’s been reviewed, and what happens next. Agreed workflows keep you close to the work.</p>
        <span class="value-footnote">Clear ownership, from day one<Icon name="arrow-up-right" size={14} /></span>
      </article>
      <article class="value-column value-insight reveal-on-scroll">
        <div class="value-art" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 230 130" fill="none"><rect x="48" y="71" width="25" height="39" rx="5" fill="#F4C3A9" /><rect x="84" y="51" width="25" height="59" rx="5" fill="#B9DAD8" /><rect x="120" y="32" width="25" height="78" rx="5" fill="#759CA1" /><rect x="156" y="13" width="25" height="97" rx="5" fill="#087F8C" /><path d="M40 118h150" stroke="#D2E3E0" stroke-width="1.5" /><path d="m54 48 40-24 37 1 35-21" stroke="#91B8B7" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-dasharray="3 4" /></svg>
          <span class="value-index">03</span>
        </div>
        <p class="value-label">PERSPECTIVE THAT MATTERS</p><h3>Beyond the numbers.<br />Into the possibilities.</h3>
        <p class="value-description">Turn current records into useful reporting. Understand cash flow, spot changes, and plan your next move with a clearer view.</p>
        <span class="value-footnote">Better context for your next decision<Icon name="arrow-up-right" size={14} /></span>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
